{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-07_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-07","title":"A Matter of Public Health","storyCode":"2-7","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"fa3cbb9ac41e1ea768f820be64eb03b03124e359aaa478a0047e67d1b7178538","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Although they did rescue some people, the homes they destroyed could not be restored, leaving everyone at a loss.\nIn order to complete the agreement with Lungmen, the group needs to move on.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you... Thank you so much..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not safe here. You should hurry and leave."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Leave...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Where... would we go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This was a place we could call home... But it's all ruined now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's not your fault..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's not..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that... is what I call bad publicity."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island does not give empty promises."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"There are few who can see through the illusion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I believe her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Misha...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful! You can't move around yet!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm just a bit dizzy... Don't worry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Is Reunion... still chasing us?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know what they want from me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's leave right away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Shortly, we'll be able to exit the slums and meet up with the L.G.D."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you, Misha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"No..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I... should be thanking you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]}]}
